        <section class="row home-section opening-attraction-section" id="openingAttraction">
          <div class="col-xl-11 mx-auto">
            <div class="opening-attraction-panel">
              <div class="opening-attraction-copy">
                <p class="section-kicker opening-attraction-kicker">Opening attraction</p>
                <h2 class="opening-attraction-title gagalin">The Practice Foundry</h2>
                <p class="opening-attraction-question hangyaboly">Why can practising harder sometimes leave us more stuck?</p>
                <p class="section-copy Poppins">A 75-minute public workshop for musicians, students, teachers, parents, returning pianists, and curious learners.</p>
                <p class="section-copy Poppins">Bring one practice frustration. Together, we will examine how intention, listening, movement, repetition, and reflection can become disconnected, then experiment with ways of joining the chain again.</p>
                <p class="opening-attraction-note recursive">No advanced musical knowledge is required.</p>
                <div class="opening-attraction-actions">
                  <a class="home-cta attraction-cta" href="#contactForm">Join the first invitation list</a>
                  <span class="opening-attraction-status recursive">Pilot gathering · Melbourne · Date to be announced</span>
                </div>
              </div>
              <ol class="attraction-route" aria-label="The Practice Foundry workshop journey">
                <li><span>01</span><strong>The Knot</strong><small>Name what keeps catching.</small></li>
                <li><span>02</span><strong>The Broken Chain</strong><small>See where practice disconnects.</small></li>
                <li><span>03</span><strong>The Workshop Floor</strong><small>Test ideas through sound and movement.</small></li>
                <li><span>04</span><strong>The Afterglow</strong><small>Leave with a clearer next experiment.</small></li>
              </ol>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

