        <section class="row home-section problem-section align-items-center">
          <div class="col-lg-7 mx-auto">
            <div class="home-display problem-panel">
              <h2 id="pedagogyh1" class="bioTitle gagalin dark-green-text">WHAT HANFORD NOTICED</h2>
              <p id="pedagogyp" class="section-copy Poppins black-text">The park begins where certainty runs out.</p>
              <p class="section-copy Poppins black-text">Confusion is not evidence that someone lacks ability. It often appears when ideas have become rushed, abstract, physically disconnected, or difficult to name.</p>
              <p class="section-note hangyaboly">Each gathering chooses one knot. We approach it from several directions and loosen enough of it for movement to become possible again.</p>
            </div>
            <iframe loading="lazy" class="soundcloud-strip" width="100%" height="166" scrolling="no" frameborder="no" allow="autoplay" src="https://w.soundcloud.com/player/?url=https%3A//api.soundcloud.com/tracks/330611534&color=%23ff5500&auto_play=false&hide_related=false&show_comments=false&show_user=false&show_reposts=false&show_teaser=false"></iframe>
          </div>
        </section>

