              <h2 class="bioTitle gagalin dark-orange-text">HOW AN ATTRACTION UNFOLDS</h2>
              <p class="section-copy Poppins black-text">An idea becomes memorable when we can encounter it, test it, and carry something away from it.</p>
              <div class="approach-steps approach-steps-four recursive">
                <span>Arrive with a question</span>
                <span>Encounter an idea</span>
                <span>Test it through experience</span>
                <span>Leave with a next path</span>
              </div>
              <p class="section-note hangyaboly">You will not leave knowing everything. You should leave wanting to continue.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-xl-4">
            <div class="responsive-container white-border home-video-frame">
              <iframe loading="lazy" width="100%" height="auto" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/zCZi2z6yWts" title="Chopin - Ballade No. 1 (Hanford in 2020)" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen></iframe>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

